    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bleu Bayou is a challenging boss rush shoot 'em up with roguelite elements, featuring the 8-bit aesthetic of your favorite handheld console. A lonesome crawdad sets out to topple the bayou's vicious syndicate of loan sharks and robber barons\u2014and erase his debt once and for all!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806790/extras/6b92646c0459c0ee4a6dcf53c2852565.poster.avif?t=1754775522\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806790/extras/6b92646c0459c0ee4a6dcf53c2852565.webm?t=1754775522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face down a dozen bosses with unique mechanics and colorful personalities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806790/extras/a723c508024c8468b24ac3cbdc38fcd6.poster.avif?t=1754775522\" width=800 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806790/extras/a723c508024c8468b24ac3cbdc38fcd6.webm?t=1754775522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806790/extras/a723c508024c8468b24ac3cbdc38fcd6.mp4?t=1754775522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hurl your trusty machete and rusty harpoon at your foes, then catch 'em on the rebound!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806790/extras/9d2a3fc3ec944ee171b5db7cdbbfe316.poster.avif?t=1754775522\" width=800 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806790/extras/9d2a3fc3ec944ee171b5db7cdbbfe316.webm?t=1754775522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806790/extras/9d2a3fc3ec944ee171b5db7cdbbfe316.mp4?t=1754775522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic 8-bit aesthetics, with an original chipgrass soundtrack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806790/extras/8921fb7e8dfdf2aa03b8af53aad1d4ba.poster.avif?t=1754775522\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806790/extras/8921fb7e8dfdf2aa03b8af53aad1d4ba.webm?t=1754775522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
