.poster.avif?t=1754775522\" width=800 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806790/extras/9d2a3fc3ec944ee171b5db7cdbbfe316.webm?t=1754775522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806790/extras/9d2a3fc3ec944ee171b5db7cdbbfe316.mp4?t=1754775522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic 8-bit aesthetics, with an original chipgrass soundtrack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806790/extras/8921fb7e8dfdf2aa03b8af53aad1d4ba.poster.avif?t=1754775522\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806790/extras/8921fb7e8dfdf2aa03b8af53aad1d4ba.webm?t=1754775522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
